Knave

Knave is a tabletop RPG by Ben Milton, with art by Peter Mullen. This app is an
unofficial companion made by J. Garrett Vorbeck; it is not made or endorsed by
the game's creators.

The code is released under the MIT license in the LICENSE file at the root of
this repository. That license does not extend to the game's content (rules,
the careers and spell names in src/rules/data, names and trademarks), which
stays with its owners.

The engraving in src/ui/dry-bones.jpg is "The Vision of the Valley of Dry Bones"
by Gustave Doré (1832-1883), signed also by the engraver Laplante. It is in the
public domain; this copy was cropped and compressed from
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Vision_of_The_Valley_of_The_Dry_Bones.jpg

The footer uses the same sentence as the old glyph.quest footer: "an independent
production of J. Garrett Vorbeck and is not affiliated with Questing Beast LLC".

